SUMMARY:Crank It Up Soccer Sculpture!
DESCRIPTION:⚽ Thank you to everyone who came out to Play On Bloor West on June 13. The fun carries on all summer. \n🎶 Discover our Special Feature Installation: Crank It Up Soccer Sculpture\, a trophy-inspired\, human-powered music box.🏆🎵⚽\nHow it works –✨ Crank for 10 to 15 seconds✨ Watch for the green lights to come on✨ Enjoy the music \nWhether you are stopping by with family\, friends\, or just embracing your inner kid again\, this interactive installation is designed to spark smiles and celebrate the spirit of play. Here all summer\, until August. \n📍Bloor West Village – Bloor St W & Willard Ave (north east corner)📸 Don’t forget to snap a photo and tag us on socials @bloorwestvillagebia \nGet in the Game. Feel the Summer.
URL:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/event/play-on-bloor-west-summer-sports-festival/
LOCATION:Bloor West Village\, Bloor Street West and Willard Avenue (South side of the Street)\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6S 1P4\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Slide-1-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloor West Village BIA":MAILTO:info@bloorwestvillagebia.com
END:VEVENT
