SUMMARY:Summer Send Off Giveaway!
DESCRIPTION:Savour the last days of summer with a meal\, coffee\, treat\, gift or shop at an independent business in Bloor West Village. \nHow to Enter\n🔹 Make a minimum purchase of $15 or more at any independent shop in Bloor West Village.\n🔹 Save your receipt (paper or email).\n🔹 Enter by August 31\, 2026 for a chance to win a $100 Bloor West Village Prize Pack.\n🔹 Winner must show proof of purchase (paper/email receipt)\n🔹 Enter Here! \nRules\n🔸 Must be an Ontario resident\, 19 or older.\n🔸 Winner must show proof of purchase (paper or email) within 48 hours of being contacted and answer the skill testing question.\n🔸 Receipts must be dated within the contest period.\n🔸 Prize must be accepted as awarded.\n🔸 Limit of one entry per household.\n🔸 Winner will be chosen randomly and announced on our socials on September 9\, and then contacted by email.
URL:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/event/summer-send-off-giveaway/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Summer-Giveaway-2.png
END:VEVENT
