SUMMARY:Swansea Summer Music Series
DESCRIPTION:🍽️ Make it a perfect summer evening—enjoy shopping and dinner on a Bloor West Village patio\, then stroll over to the Swansea Summer Music Series! 🎶 Every Tuesday night in August\, the piazza comes alive with incredible performances from local bands. 🎸 \n📅 Every Tuesday night in August | 6:30 to 8:30 pm\n📍 Swansea Town Hall\, 95 Lavinia Avenue \n \n  \nHere’s the full lineup – \n🔹 Aug 4 – Jade Lizard and the Paper Tigers  (Reggae\, Rocksteady\, Ska)\n🔹 Aug 11 – The Lucky Pennies (Folkabilly)\n🔹 Aug 18 – Easy Rider  (Country)\n🔹 Aug 25 – The Bentley Collective (Jazz\, Folk\, Blues) \n  \nBloor West Village BIA is proud to be sponsoring this event! \nMore info: https://www.swanseatownhall.ca/programs/music/ \n 
URL:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/event/swansea-summer-music-series-2/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Swansea-Music-Evenings-2.png
END:VEVENT
